<title>USA: Overseas Shipholding Q3 full results.</title>
<headline>Overseas Shipholding Q3 full results.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>THREE MONTHS ENDED		 NINE MONTHS ENDED</p>
<p>		  SEP 30	    SEP				 30</p>
<p>		   1996	  1995		    1996	1995</p>
<p>Shipping</p>
<p>Revenues</p>
<p>	  $105,106,000 $ 99,569,000 $346,796,000   $299,034,000</p>
<p>Net Income/ (Loss) (a)(b)</p>
<p>	(767,000)    (746,000)     $7,678,000     $(10,036,000)</p>
<p>Net Income/ (Loss) Per</p>
<p> Share	(.02)	  (.02)	   $.21		$(.28)</p>
<p>Average Number of Shares Outstanding</p>
<p>	    36,234,000   36,224,000 36,233,000	 36,218,000</p>
<p>Note: (a) Gains from disposal of vessels in 1996, net of income tax, amounted to $4,482,000 ($.12 per share) all in the first half of the year.</p>
<p>There were no gains from disposal of vessels in the first nine months of 1995.</p>
<p>(b) In 1996, there was an income tax credit in the third quarter of $2,500,000 and a provision for income taxes of $3,100,000 in the first nine months.</p>
<p>In 1995, there were income tax credits of $1,600,000 in the third quarter and $6,050,000 in the first nine months.</p>
<p>Note: Full company name is Overseas Shipholding Group Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
